📚 CLUB MENU
</div>

<div class="buttons">

<div class="btn about-btn">
    📘 About
</div>

<div class="btn">🏆 Tournaments</div>

<div class="btn">📜 Rules</div>

<div class="btn">🥇 Ranking</div>

</div>

<div class="website">
🌐 Visit Bullet Viet Nam Website
</div>

<div class="box">

